# CMake build trees this repo writes INTO the checkout: build-llvm.sh configures `-B llvm-build`,
# and the compat gate `-B gate-build`. An LLVM build tree is enormous and its CMakeCache bakes in
# absolute paths, so neither survives being committed usefully -- and `work/ out/ dist/` above never
# covered either of them.
gate-build/
llvm-build/
